bug-themed crime fighters,

00:08:45.033 --> 00:08:50.000
or one of the most powerful
magic wielders on the planet,

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.868
it's an easy call.

00:08:51.868 --> 00:08:53.601
-Yeah, that's what
I'm talking about.

00:08:53.601 --> 00:08:55.834
Elizabeth Olsen, everybody.

00:08:55.834 --> 00:08:58.234
"Doctor Strange
in the Multiverse of Madness"

00:08:58.234 --> 00:09:00.634
